  "version": "0.1.0",
  "citeAs": "Cao, Ren-Meng; Liu, Xiao-Fan; Xu, Xiao-Ke (2021). Why cannot long-term cascade be predicted? Exploring temporal dynamics in information diffusion processes [Dataset]. Dryad. https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.44j0zpccv",
